            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;timeline-range-name&gt;</code> is in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3643189000\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42020\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42020/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42020\">#42020</a>, so will be added around the same time as this.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42029",
            "title": "CSS property pages: animation-range-start and animation-range-end",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-20T09:51:51.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-20T09:50:03.000Z",
